 Fonts  Effects  Looks  Flow  Settings  Help
 draft mine · no changes · no problems               text preview · t: try live
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Fonts lists the font sets (frits) and the built-in fonts, with any font files
 each is missing. Below the list, the console draws every character of the
 preview in the font it uses now. Press t to try the highlighted font on the
 console, k to keep it, and s to save it in the draft. Press n to make a new
 font set.
     Enter choose  t try live  s save  n new  r remove  i install  q quit

 Effects will list the color maps and shaders that a look can use. It lists
 none yet.
     Tab next view  s save  i install  q quit

 Looks lists the console's font sizes, automatic first, with a preview of each.
 Later it will manage the looks, each a font set and a size.
     Enter choose  Tab next view  i install  q quit without installing

 The Flow view: CONFIGURATION, NEW PATH and PARTS
   ↑          Moves to the box above.
   ↓          Moves to the box below.
   ←          Moves to the box before, and on to the line before.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ↑↓ scroll  ←→ Help, About  q quit  . more 1/4
